30: - GitLab — GitHub only for visibility and links. <!-- ponytail: normalize handles any host; add GitLab visibility check when a GitLab repo shows up -->
31: - Auto-deploy on push — provenance is recorded, not acted on. <!-- ponytail: needs webhooks + stored tokens; separate feature if ever -->
32: - Private-repo linking via tokens — private repos get plain SHAs, never a stored token. <!-- ponytail: deliberate; tokens in the control plane are a new threat class -->","packages/cli/lib/source.js":"1: 'use strict';
2: const { spawnSync } = require('child_process');
